The previous `use` line used a versioned path followed directly by `.{`, which the WIT parser rejects. The fix is to omit the version in the `use` line. Because the platform team approved an `http-client` import, the world now declares it, and the enrichment fetch is best-effort so its result never affects the output.

```wit
